WEBVTT

00:03:28.192 --> 00:03:31.101
Six months later,
after WeWork filed for an IPO,

00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:32.712
a series of investigative reports

00:03:32.736 --> 00:03:34.965
exposed their huge financial losses.

00:03:35.307 --> 00:03:38.348
The media was in an uproar
over the self-dealing behavior

00:03:38.372 --> 00:03:40.491
of the cofounder and CEO, Adam Neumann.

00:03:40.515 --> 00:03:44.026
Woman 1: Adam Neumann pays
a direct family member

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.421
to be the director
of wellness at the company.

00:03:46.445 --> 00:03:48.856
Man: There's credible reports
in the business press

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:52.110
that he traveled with illegal drugs
across international boundaries.

00:03:52.134 --> 00:03:54.672
Woman 2: Expenses at WeWork
more than quadrupled.

00:03:54.696 --> 00:03:58.197
Man 2: Adam Neumann
is stepping down as CEO.

00:03:58.221 --> 00:04:00.193
AG: Plenty of people are still dissecting